id: pm-swarm-identity-unbrained
title: Use the unbrained commit identity
description: "Apply the 2026-11-19 owner decision to tracked fixtures, documentation, and PM history. Verify identity mapping and package gates."
type: Chore
pm_format_version: 2
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-19T11:34:44.836Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T15:13:17.558Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T11:34:59.176Z",codex-sol,The owner selected unbrained as the fleet commit name and retained the existing noreply address. Verify package checks and reseal affected PM histories.
  "2026-11-19T12:16:36.190Z",codex-sol,"The first test selector also matched longer helper names and started the exhaustive crash matrix. Verify the suites that directly import the changed fixtures or runtime modules, the privacy suites, and the install fixture."
  "2026-11-19T12:26:56.116Z",codex-sol,An inherited npm option refused two packed npm fixtures before their assertions ran. Five install cases passed. Run the two npm fixtures with the user configuration disabled.
  "2026-11-19T12:31:04.712Z",codex-sol,"Both packed npm cases passed with the user npm configuration disabled. Together with the original run, all seven install cases reached their behavioral assertions and passed."
  "2026-11-19T12:47:09.746Z",codex-sol,"The tracker, typecheck, changelog, packed install cases and completed test cases were verified. The remaining local suites were still running when the round reached its cutoff. Preserve this candidate on the package worktree."
  "2026-11-19T13:57:25.289Z",codex-sol,Round DT resumes the verified redaction candidate and will finish the complete source and packaged-install suites before push. The fetched main still matches the candidate parent.
  "2026-11-19T14:38:58.127Z",codex-sol,"The complete packaged-install suite passed all seven tests, including npm and Bun native compensation recovery. The full source suite continues. The fleet path-privacy acceptance test and linked edge tests passed."
  "2026-11-19T15:13:15.360Z",codex-sol,"The full source suite passed 1242 tests with zero failures, cancellations, or skips. The packaged npm and Bun suite passed all seven tests. The linked edge test, fleet privacy acceptance test, typecheck, identity gate, mailmap comparison, and both history rechecks passed. The existing identity commit still applies directly to main."
